{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "003hok_310_2_3_003_10_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fcda8cf3ddd1f3cad39178099ad7103ee055668025b4848cb7bebb75a149d1aa",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:003hok_310_2_3_003_10_09_a:2_3_003_10_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:538d40c9604e3624678f0c6f866ff2faec03ef86fe8b96e4380599f5cb9cf51f",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n广播录制辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_310_2_3_003_10_09_a:2_3_003_10_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dce884c124bc22085802c23fa0deb5348cdb326d155945dc4e22a274658357cb",
      "text": "这次，收到了超乎想象的众多天使酱和\n天使君寄来的恋爱咨询，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_310_2_3_003_10_09_a:2_3_003_10_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4f13ce0e1c2d2efa623b6ac83ed7c8dd6d0dd47912688b9a4745b5885b10266",
      "text": "说实话，邮件的分量让我吃了一惊。\n大家各自都怀揣着烦恼呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_310_2_3_003_10_09_a:2_3_003_10_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd6eb7225ab25a901c8836fcf4bd44dde77732cd858d82b34585873c9505c357",
      "text": "不过，在倾听那些烦恼咨询的过程中，\n我意识到了一点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_310_2_3_003_10_09_a:2_3_003_10_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d83262b8bea751713ca72e44b9f4e525b4f67c273dae38c68e36ec4f6403f47b",
      "text": "身为偶像的我们，有着鼓励粉丝、\n带给他们勇气的力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_310_2_3_003_10_09_a:2_3_003_10_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84fe1a672aa81e6730c56fbe9d1d994ba4c52f085e6ee69f5270317bd74b4a35",
      "text": "作为粉丝的精神支柱站在舞台上，\n正因为是我们，才有着能够传达到的心意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_310_2_3_003_10_09_a:2_3_003_10_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c863a0e48288b81bb4d45e7444cc6b211c081e35bbcef4c30cc50b1b1bd4b91f",
      "text": "我再次切实地意识到，\n这一定是其他任何人都无法做到的事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_310_2_3_003_10_09_a:2_3_003_10_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56dd87bc146de531f903867394fbd2425a6a33d1394f2fdd6462ff4aad336a8e",
      "text": "我觉得这种心情\n非常宝贵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_310_2_3_003_10_09_a:2_3_003_10_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86c8a10fab73aa2ff10fdd3eb89639b5da14a645b0fdfb0c0e044011e43b85a2",
      "text": "请一定一直\n牢记这份心情",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_310_2_3_003_10_09_a:2_3_003_10_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbb6d1bd296e95242401af080876fd37a02e8433ed3b9befcbdaec907003c063",
      "text": "嗯，是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_310_2_3_003_10_09_a:2_3_003_10_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fafa33b6b47274ad3b0a24e8c75d6e36528eb7ae931681066a665e1ca53f4399",
      "text": "这次的工作成了宝贵的经验。\n在这里领会到的心情，我今后也不会忘记的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:003hok_310_2_3_003_10_09_a:2_3_003_10_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7c1d52d4845da7eaac2d1af2c5e61884833fb1bdec2416a249f4ca7eeadb825",
      "text": "今后我也想继续给天使酱们\n带去笑容☆",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
